            <div type="edition">
                <div type="textpart" subtype="incipit" xml:lang="gez">
                    <note>The following incipit is taken from the edition <bibl><ptr target="bm:Arras1953GeorgiusText"/>
                        <citedRange unit="page">90</citedRange><citedRange unit="item">61</citedRange></bibl>.</note>
                    <ab>፷፩። ተአምሪሁ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/> ወሀሎ፡ ፩፡
                        ዲያቆን፡ ዘይሴሰይ፡ መባአ፡ ቤተ፡ ክርስቲያን። ወአሐተ፡ እለተ፡ ሶበ፡ ኢመጽአ፡ መባአ፡ ቤተ፡ ክርስቲያን፡ ቦአ፡ ውእቱ፡ ዲያቆን፡ ውስተ፡ ቤተ፡ ክርስቲያን፡
                        ዘቅዱስ፡ ማር፡ ጊዮርጊስ፡ ነሢኦ፡ አዕፁቀ፡ ዕፅ። ወዘበጦ፡ ለሠርዌ፡ ቤተ፡ መቅደስ።</ab>
                </div>
                <div type="textpart" subtype="incipit" xml:lang="gez">
                    <note>This incipit is taken from <ref type="mss" corresp="ANLcr15"/> according to the catalogue description in 
                        <bibl><ptr target="bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue"/><citedRange unit="page">52</citedRange></bibl>.</note>
                    <ab>ተአምሪሁ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/> ወካዕበ፡ ፩
                        ዲያቆን፡ ዘይሴሰይ፡ መባዓ፡ ለቤተ፡ ክርስቲያን፡ ቦአ፡ ውስተ፡ ቤተ፡ ክርስቲያን፡
                        ዘቅዱስ፡ ማር፡ ጊዮርጊስ፡ ነሢኦ፡ አዕፁቀ፡ ዕፅ፡ ወዘበጠ፡
                        ሰርዌ፡ ቤተ፡ መቅደስ፡</ab>
                </div>
                <div type="textpart" subtype="explicit" xml:lang="gez">
                    <note>This explicit is taken from the edition <bibl>
                        <ptr target="bm:Arras1953GeorgiusText"/>
                        <citedRange unit="page">90</citedRange><citedRange unit="item">61</citedRange></bibl>.</note>
                    <ab>
                       ወናሁ፡ ኃደገ፡ ከይዶትየ፡ ወሀሎ፡ ይቀውም፡ ዝየ። ወአንከሩ፡ እለ፡ ርእዩ፡ ተአምሪሁ፡ ለሰማዕት፡ ቅዱስ፡ ጊዮርጊስ፡ ማር።
                       ጸሎቱ፡ ወበረከቱ፡ የሃሉ፡ ምስለ፡ ፍቁሩ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/>
